        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "11. MCCSSE will be authorized to use the interschool mail facility to distribute official MCCSSE material. Printed materials or literature indicating MCCSSE's position concerning any candidate for public office may not be distributed through the interschool facility. Use of the facility to distribute material detrimental to the goals and purposes of MCPS or material in violation of the law is expressly prohibited. Such use will be in accordance with procedures established by the superintendent. Violation of this section will result in loss of use of the facility for the remainder of the period of the Agreement.",
